  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 14 new plugins, reaching 19,391 total, while growth was almost entirely driven by Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model with +135 stars; other top projects moved only single digits. The official repo merged the 0.2.1-alpha.2 release PR, but with a health score of 38 and 15,265 plugins stale for 7+ days, activity concentration is worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>14</b> 个插件，总量达 <b>19391</b>；增长几乎由 Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model 一个项目拉动，单日涨 <b>135</b> 星，其余头部项目仅个位数波动。官方仓库合并了 0.2.1-alpha.2 发布 PR，但健康分仅 <b>38</b>、<b>15265</b> 个插件 7 天无更新，建议持续观察活跃度分化。"
